Z||000000||JohnnyK||11-06-2000||07:45 PM||||My ex-girlfriends sister bought a 1984 BMW 325, got taken for a ride, and now just wants to get rid of it because she doesn't want/have the time to fix it. They said they would give it away for $300. Her dad said it needs floors redone (they are rusted through), a strut or spring or something welded (said something abotu cmopressing the spring), the power steering rack seal, and the lifters adjusted.. What do you guys think? Thanks ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||11-06-2000||07:57 PM||||Unless you have lots of $ to fix rusted cars stay away from it as far as you can.  It may have salvage material in the car which may be usable.  But I don't think it will be drivable for long unless a lot of expensive work is done to it.||||reg||1
